  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: We are a small US based pin supplier and custom promotional product company.&nbsp; We work with companies, brands, and artists to put their logos and designs in front of their customers.&nbsp; We've been in business for 8 years, and have a large repeat customer base.&nbsp; Most customers return to reorder.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Product description: We offer all custom promotional products including pins, keychains, lanyards, canopies, table throws, banner signs, and more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): FREE custom packaging with all pin orders.&nbsp; We also have the best pin deals around, like our \"$.99 pin deal\" (1,000 quantity order) and our \"5 Designs Deal\" (buy 4 designs, get one free)&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Payment terms: Easy ordering and checkout process, using all major platforms.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Other information:&nbsp; We LOVE working with affiliates!&nbsp; If you'd like in-hand promotional products or affiliate cards to pass out at events, please email us!</p>\r\n</div>",
